# ==============================================================================
# MASTER ENVIRONMENT ARCHITECTURE
# ==============================================================================
# This project splits configuration between the Backend and Frontend services.
# Do not copy this specific file to a local .env file in the root directory.
#
# Instead, follow the instructions below to configure each ecosystem independently.
# ==============================================================================

--> BACKEND CONFIGURATION
    Location: ./backend/.env.example
    Action:   Navigate to the /server folder, duplicate its .env.example to .env, 
              and configure your MongoDB URI, JWT secrets, and port details.

--> FRONTEND CONFIGURATION
    Location: ./frontend/.env.example
    Action:   Navigate to the /client folder, duplicate its .env.example to .env, 
              and point your environment variables to the backend server's URL.